{"version":1,"content":"<p>每年農曆九、十月秋冬均是「蟹中之王」大閘蟹最肥美之時，食饕當然要趁機大擦豐腴蟹黃及創意蟹饌。</p><p>有中菜廳以新穎配搭炮製出主題盛宴；</p><p>亦有福建餐廳將閩南飲食元素與大閘蟹結合，打造出色香味全菜餚，讓大家用舌尖體驗與別不同的極致旬味。</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:50.361770+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T06:00:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771600+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771600+00:00","content_hash":"d04316165246c8f6433ad47011ddead011aa05ea10513c39cb705aca8c858adf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}